OL,3,GNEWSARoller 'absolutely' secures future
OL,4,Aof cricket club
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of a village cricket club
OL,7,Fhas "absolutely" been secured when its
OL,8,Fvintage roller was replaced with a new
OL,9,Fone after the community raised
OL,10,Fthousands of pounds.
OL,12,FBattisford and District Cricket Club's
OL,13,F80-year-old roller conked out in June
OL,14,Fas club owner David Stevens-Row was in
OL,15,Fthe middle of going over the cricket
OL,16,Fsquare.
OL,18,FIt left the club forking out #400 a
OL,19,Fweek to hire a roller, an expensive
OL,20,Foutlay which was not financially
OL,21,Fsustainable and raised concerns that
OL,22,Fplay may have to be stopped.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
