OL,3,GNEWSARoller 'absolutely' secures future
OL,4,Aof cricket club
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut those concerns have been hit for
OL,7,Fsix after the community rallied round
OL,8,Fto help the club raise nearly #12,000,
OL,9,Fwhich it has used to buy second-hand
OL,10,Froller.
